{"id": "51202", "title": "禾奶绿（限）", "author": "禾奶绿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/51/51202.htm", "intro": "cj的孩子请绕道~~~~ \r\n\r\n等渡濑香钏被阳光的温度暖醒时，已经七点十分了。香钏从软的陷下去的大床中跳起，急急忙忙中还弄掉了闹钟那个使她惊慌失措的凶手，刚掀开细柔舒服的鹅毛被，冷空气就攫住了她，只穿单薄黑色丝质睡衣的香钏忍不住轻叫出声。白嫩的皮肤因为寒冷而泛起红潮，胸前的粉红草莓也在黑纱睡衣中绽放。", "base": "files/article/html/51/51202", "chapters": [{"title": "1-1 来不及穿内衣(限)", "file": "7301660.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-2(完) 厨房破坏王(限)", "file": "7301664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2-1 被抓回去了(限)", "file": "7301665.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2-2(完) 床上和(限)", "file": "7301666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3-1 脱光光睡觉(限)", "file": "7301667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3-2(完) 他的生日(限)", "file": "7301668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-1 认识帅哥", "file": "7301669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-2 不要一直搞暧昧", "file": "7301670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-3 弄假成真", "file": "7301671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-4 情窦初开(限)", "file": "7301672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-5 生病也要做(限)", "file": "7301673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-6 没有理由(限)", "file": "7301674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-7(完) 情敌退散(限)", "file": "7301675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-8番外 不爱嫂嫂(限)", "file": "7301676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-1 好朋友是狼(限)", "file": "7301677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-2 淫乱的初夜(限)", "file": "7301678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-3(完) 擦药擦到哪去(限)", "file": "7301679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-1 一大早就发情(限)", "file": "7301680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-2(完) 男人生气了(限)", "file": "7301683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7(完) 牙刷新功能(限)", "file": "7301685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8(完) 老公回家(限)", "file": "7301686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-1 他居然瞪美女", "file": "7301687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9 番外(限) 圣诞礼物", "file": "